   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formation of the «tu» imperative",
     "texto": [
      "In the first conjugation (**-are**), the «tu» imperative ends in **-a**: **riposare → riposa!**, **parlare → parla!**, **ascoltare → ascolta!**.",
      "In the second (**-ere**) and third conjugation (**-ire**), it ends in **-i**: **prendere → prendi!**, **dormire → dormi!**, **sentire → senti!**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Common irregular «tu» imperatives",
     "texto": [
      "Several everyday verbs have monosyllabic or apocopated forms with an apostrophe: **fare → fa' / fai!**, **andare → va' / vai!**, **dare → da' / dai!**, **dire → di'!**, **stare → sta' / stai!**. **bere** becomes **bevi!**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Affirmative «tu» imperative",
     "columnas": [
